OL,3,AGruffalo illustrator considering legal
OL,4,Aaction against AI firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe illustrator behind the popular
OL,7,Fchildren's book The Gruffalo has told
OL,8,FBBC London he is "seriously
OL,9,Fconsidering" launching legal action
OL,10,Fagainst artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,11,Ffirms he says breach copyright in
OL,12,Freproducing his work.
OL,14,FAxel Scheffler, whose illustrations
OL,15,Fhave captivated children since 1999,
OL,16,Fsaid he wanted AI companies to stop
OL,17,Fusing artists' work without permission.
OL,19,FThe Gruffalo, written by London-born
OL,20,Fchildren's author Julia Donaldson,
OL,21,Ftells the story of a mouse who
OL,22,Foutsmarts a beast.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
